WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:16.880
So Twitter, for the first time has flagged
Trump tweets as possibly misleading.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.880
Essentially a flag they've established to
signal fake news.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:27.210
And Donald Trump has absolutely lost his mind
and is talking even about shutting down social

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.010
media platforms that do this.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:33.850
Now, I told you yesterday that Twitter, they
kind of have special rules for politicians

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:40.480
and prominent figures where normally, for
example, you would not be allowed to accuse

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:45.550
random people of murder on Twitter and sic
your followers on them.

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.700
But Donald Trump did that to Joe Scarborough.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:52.710
And Twitter allows it because they say when
Trump does it, it in and of itself is newsworthy

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:58.710
and thus it should be allowed to stay because
it is the catalyst for much reporting.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:02.760
It's newsworthy in and of itself because of
the person who is doing it.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:08.350
So yesterday, Donald Trump sent out two tweets
with absolute lies about vote by mail and

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:11.390
Twitter, flagged them both and provided fact
checking.

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:13.200
And Donald Trump lost his.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:14.200
You know what?

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:18.420
And this is a technique that Twitter put in
place similar to one that Facebook has when

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:20.790
fake news articles are posted.

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:23.300
And this is infuriating to Trump.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:26.040
Let's check out the claims and then the truth.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:31.000
And this is so important, not just because
good for Twitter, for fact checking the president,

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:36.030
but it's important because vote by mail is
again becoming sort of like the new battle

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:38.270
line in the upcoming 2020 election.

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:43.700
Donald Trump said there is no way zero that
mail in ballots will be anything less than

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:45.450
substantially fraudulent.

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:49.730
Mailboxes will be robbed, ballots will be
forged and even illegally printed out and

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:51.570
fraudulently signed.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:55.940
The government of California, the governor
of California, is sending ballots to millions

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.200
of people.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:01.530
Anyone living in the state, no matter who
they are or how they got there, will get one

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:05.060
that will be followed up with professionals
telling all of these people, many of whom

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:09.340
have never even thought of voting before,
how and for whom to vote.

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.239
This will be a rigged election.

00:02:11.239 --> 00:02:12.239
No way.

00:02:12.239 --> 00:02:15.709
Now, as you can see, if you're looking at
this, there's a flag there with an exclamation

00:02:15.709 --> 00:02:20.580
point that says get the facts about mail in
ballots, sort of an instant fact check, which

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:25.390
tells you, if you click it, that Donald Trump
is falsely claiming that mail in ballots would

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:27.180
lead to a rigged election.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.180
That's not true.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:31.290
There's no evidence that mail in ballots are
linked to voter fraud.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:36.310
Trump falsely claims California is going to
send mail in ballots to anyone no matter how

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:40.940
they got there, implying undocumented immigrants
would get ballots, in fact.

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:45.680
Not only is that not true, only registered
voters would receive ballots.

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:48.240
If you live in California but are not registered
to vote.

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:50.340
You won't get a ballot at all.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:54.080
Five states have already voted entirely by
mail.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:58.910
All states offer some kind of absentee voting,
according to NBC News.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:05.360
Also part of the fact check now, the right
wingers who love to cry about anti conservative

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:08.470
discrimination on Twitter and Facebook.

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:10.740
They are slamming Twitter for this.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:13.330
But this is exactly what Twitter needs to
be doing.

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:19.120
CNN and MSNBC and FOX News should be doing
it during Trump and Kaley Maguindanao, his

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:20.140
press briefings.

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:24.730
I've talked about responsible platforming,
instant fact checking.

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:27.459
This is how Donald Trump's tweets should also
be handled.

00:03:27.459 --> 00:03:34.140
Now, the amazing thing is when Twitter did
this, Trump tweeted an apology for spreading

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.140
fake news.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:39.610
Trump deleted his tweets and he thanked Twitter
for correcting him.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:42.010
Now, obviously, that's not true.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:45.709
Trump absolutely lost it when Twitter did
this, attacking them.

00:03:45.709 --> 00:03:49.640
And CNN and The Washington Post for some reason
tweeting, quote.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:53.730
Twitter is now interfering in the 2020 presidential
election.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:57.370
They're saying my statement on mail in ballots,
which will lead to massive corruption and

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:02.540
fraud, is incorrect based on fact checking
by fake news.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:09.280
CNN and the Amazon Washington Post adding
that, quote, Twitter is completely stifling

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.480
free speech.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.950
And I as president will not allow it to happen.

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:19.540
Then Trump actually tweeting about shutting
platforms down, tweeting, quote, Republicans

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:24.750
feel that social media platforms totally silenced
conservatives voices.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:31.199
We will strongly regulate or close them down
before we can ever allow this to happen.

00:04:31.199 --> 00:04:35.210
We saw what they attempted to do and failed
in 2016.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:40.559
We can't let a more sophisticated version
of that happen again, just like we can't let

00:04:40.559 --> 00:04:44.099
large scale mail in ballots take root in our
country.

00:04:44.099 --> 00:04:48.759
It would be a free for all on cheating, forgery
and the theft of ballots.

00:04:48.759 --> 00:04:51.389
Whoever cheated the most would win.

00:04:51.389 --> 00:04:57.270
Likewise, social media clean up your act now.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:05:02.689
Extremely dangerous dystopian totalitarian
language from the president.

00:05:02.689 --> 00:05:04.099
We cannot relent on this.

00:05:04.099 --> 00:05:06.629
I implore Twitter not to relent.

00:05:06.629 --> 00:05:10.990
I implore other platforms and media outlets
on TV to.

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:13.189
Do the exact same thing.

00:05:13.189 --> 00:05:15.279
Instant fact checking of Donald Trump.

00:05:15.279 --> 00:05:20.250
What would be amazing would be if Twitter
fact checked Trump's attack on Twitter.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:21.250
Right.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:24.379
Like is interference in the elections.

00:05:24.379 --> 00:05:26.610
Inclusive of just fact checking the president?

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:28.410
No, that's a lie.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:32.219
Are Trump's claims about massive corruption
and fraud incorrect?

00:05:32.219 --> 00:05:33.960
Yes, those are not true.

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:36.039
Is fact checking by CNN.

00:05:36.039 --> 00:05:37.039
Incorrect?

00:05:37.039 --> 00:05:38.639
No, Trump is wrong.

00:05:38.639 --> 00:05:40.789
Now, it should be mentioned.

00:05:40.789 --> 00:05:48.569
This is the president saying Twitter doing
fact checks has something to do with the Constitution's

00:05:48.569 --> 00:05:49.830
First Amendment.

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:55.060
Trump is accusing Twitter of violating his
First Amendment rights.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.249
Can you imagine?

00:05:56.249 --> 00:06:02.819
Can you imagine a president this incompetent
when it comes to the basics of what the First

00:06:02.819 --> 00:06:03.940
Amendment is?

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:10.159
Twitter has the same First Amendment right
to decide which falsehoods and lies they will

00:06:10.159 --> 00:06:14.639
allow to spread on their private platform,
just like other private businesses have the

00:06:14.639 --> 00:06:16.300
ability and right to do.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:20.819
This was a big topic when I was on with Joe
Rogan on Friday.

00:06:20.819 --> 00:06:22.439
What should the limits be here?

00:06:22.439 --> 00:06:29.309
Whose rights extend how far when it comes
to what Twitter can be compelled to do versus

00:06:29.309 --> 00:06:35.559
what Twitter is allowed to do as an organization
that has terms and conditions? Trump is going

00:06:35.559 --> 00:06:38.289
to put huge pressure on Twitter and other
platforms.

00:06:38.289 --> 00:06:41.270
It is very clear this is part of the culture
war.

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:43.490
This is part of the battle lines now.

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:45.229
I want this to escalate.

00:06:45.229 --> 00:06:51.210
Twitter actually could get Trump to completely
lose his mind if they keep up the fact checking

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.500
with all of his tweets with accurate information.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:54.810
Good for Twitter.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:59.219
I'm not endorsing or criticizing anything
else about Twitter other than this is the

00:06:59.219 --> 00:07:00.440
right thing to do.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.729
They should keep doing it.

00:07:01.729 --> 00:07:06.550
Look at how instantly triggered Donald Trump
was will follow what will certainly be a wild

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:10.740
next 24 to 48 hours as the fallout from this
continues.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:12.270
Keep an eye out.

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:14.499
One other warning and then I want to move
on.

00:07:14.499 --> 00:07:25.149
Keep an eye out for how people around Trump
are going to create specious special pleadings

00:07:25.149 --> 00:07:28.530
to argue that Twitter should be banned from
doing this.

00:07:28.530 --> 00:08:36.940
Essentially, we'll follow up on that when

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:39.380
it happens.

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:52.550
Well, let's give it time to develop.

